# Firebase Project Setup
# =====================
# This project requires several Firebase configuration files that are gitignored for security.
# Follow these steps to set up your local environment:
#
# 1. Run `flutterfire configure` to generate:
#    - lib/firebase_options.dart
#    - ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist
#    - macos/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist
#    - android/app/google-services.json
#
# 2. Create ios/Runner/FirebaseSecrets.xcconfig with:
#    GID_CLIENT_ID = <your Google client ID from GoogleService-Info.plist>
#    REVERSED_CLIENT_ID = <your reversed client ID from GoogleService-Info.plist>
#
# See each .example file for more details on expected format.
